"},{"text":"In-House Internship"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Commercial Contract Portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest graduate profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Corporate Counsel","Commercial Lawyer","Contract Negotiator","Compliance & Risk Advisor","Business-Literate Legal Professional","Legal-Tech/AI-Aware Counsel"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the biggest differentiator is business-oriented legal thinking. A successful Corporate Counsel does not merely identify what the law says; they understand what the business is trying to achieve, identify the legal and commercial risks, propose practical alternatives, negotiate acceptable terms and help the company execute its strategy within the law."}]}]}